BT /F1 11 Tf 50 750 Td (DEMO SAFETY SOP) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Document ID: SOP-SAFETY-001) Tj T*
(Version: 1.0) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. Personal Protective Equipment) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(All personnel entering the industrial floor must wear:) Tj T*
(  - Safety helmet) Tj T*
(  - Steel-toe boots) Tj T*
(  - High-visibility vest) Tj T*
(  - Safety glasses) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2. Emergency Shutdown Procedure) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(In case of fire or critical equipment failure:) Tj T*
(  1. Press the nearest emergency stop button.) Tj T*
(  2. Evacuate personnel from the area.) Tj T*
(  3. Notify the control room immediately.) Tj T*
(  4. Do not re-enter until cleared by safety officer.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
