6 0 obj
<< /Length 422 >>
stream
BT /F1 11 Tf 50 750 Td (3. Lockout/Tagout Procedure) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Before any maintenance work on energized equipment:) Tj T*
(  1. Identify all energy sources.) Tj T*
(  2. Notify the affected personnel.) Tj T*
(  3. Shut down the equipment using normal procedure.) Tj T*
(  4. Isolate the energy source.) Tj T*
(  5. Apply lockout/tagout device.) Tj T*
(  6. Verify that energy is isolated before proceeding.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
